{"id":1740,"date":"2026-08-24T14:35:23","date_gmt":"2026-08-24T14:35:23","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1740"},"modified":"2026-08-24T15:43:16","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T15:43:16","slug":"password-protection","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/security-privacy\/password-protection\/","title":{"rendered":"Password Protection"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Password Protection<\/span><\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1755\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtection.webp\" alt=\"Password Protection\" width=\"117\" height=\"122\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtection.webp 898w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtection-286x300.webp 286w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtection-768x806.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 117px) 100vw, 117px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher allows you to fully encrypt any document with a password using the industry-standard <strong>AES-GCM<\/strong> encryption algorithm, implemented natively in the browser via the Web Crypto API. Once protected, the file saves as an encrypted binary blob rather than a readable <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.html<\/span> or <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> structure &#8211; the content is completely unreadable to anyone who does not have the correct password.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Protect a Document<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1751\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2.webp\" alt=\"How to Protect a Document\" width=\"156\" height=\"174\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2.webp 380w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2-268x300.webp 268w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 156px) 100vw, 156px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Protect Document<\/strong>, or click the <strong>Protect Document<\/strong> button in the ribbon.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enter a password and confirm it in the dialog.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click <strong>Protect<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">Once protected, a <strong>Protected<\/strong> badge appears in the top-right area of the canvas, giving you immediate visual confirmation that the active document is secured.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening a Protected Document<\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> file as normal.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A decryption prompt immediately appears.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enter the correct password. If it matches, the document decrypts and loads instantly.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">If the password is incorrect, the document remains locked.<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1743\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected.webp\" alt=\"Opening a Protected Document and Pritecting a document\" width=\"833\" height=\"214\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected.webp 1808w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected-300x77.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected-1024x263.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected-768x197.webp 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PasswordProtected-1536x394.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 833px) 100vw, 833px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Important: No Password Recovery<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1745\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WarningNoPasswordRecovery.webp\" alt=\"No Password Recovery\" width=\"127\" height=\"128\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WarningNoPasswordRecovery.webp 419w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WarningNoPasswordRecovery-297x300.webp 297w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WarningNoPasswordRecovery-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>There is no password recovery mechanism.<\/strong> If you lose or forget the password, the document cannot be recovered under any circumstances. Always keep a backup copy of the unprotected source file stored securely before applying password protection.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Password Protection Open Publisher allows you to fully encrypt any document with a password using the industry-standard AES-GCM encryption algorithm, implemented natively in the browser via the Web Crypto API. Once protected, the file saves as an encrypted binary blob rather than a readable .html or .opub structure &#8211; the content is completely unreadable to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1755,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[22],"class_list":["post-1740","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-security-privacy"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1740","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1740"}],"version-history":[{"count":12,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1740\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1759,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1740\/revisions\/1759"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1755"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1740"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1740"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}